## Hardware Setup 

### Programer

To program the board you will need a UPDI programmer. There are many options:


| Programmer | Cost | Ease of Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| jtag2updi| $4-5 [Free if you have a spare Arduino] | Hard |
| SerialUPDI [DIY] | $4-5 | Moderate |
| Microchip Curiosty Nano | $15-25 | Easiest |
